    {
      "start": 496.28,
      "end": 505.4,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "targetIndex": 9,
      "targetText": "如果这是唯一显露信心之途那么任何没有行为的信心都不能算是真的",
      "confidence": 0.967
    },
    {
      "start": 505.4,
      "end": 589.3,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "targetIndex": 10,
